==Battleground==
*2 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[High Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to collect all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1, 2, & 3 before attempting this stage... seriously, you'll need them to deal with Imperator Sael. Upgrade your Wallet to level 4 and let the Cat Base tank a few hits from the peons, then save up for [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]] to nuke them. Afterwards, you'll want to stall the Kroxos for a bit with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] while you build up cash. Giga-Nyan's attack rate is somewhat slow and it takes a while for the mecha to kill each peon individually. Start spawning [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]], [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], and [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Rangers]] once Giga-Nyan initiates the boss wave.

High Countess Koryessa's Wave Attacks basically guarantee you'll eventually be pushed back to the Cat Base even with Wave Shields, so your main priority should be nuking the Imperator Saels out of existence with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] when they spawn. They are quite tanky otherwise, and you'll drain most of your cash trying to deal with them normally, since Koryessa consistently evaporates all defenses you put up. Try to deal with all peons as cheaply as you can ([[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] is a good answer to the Kroxos), and hold your ground until the next Imperator Sael spawns. When he does, clear the field of peons with Giga-Nyan, then time a second Awakened Bahamut Cat to chain him. Beyond this point, Kroxos will rarely spawn, which means you can safely tank with Yellow Nyanko Rangers until the horde of Madam Pengs finally let up and you can counterattack. The regular [[Cat Cannon]] and [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] can push back the bosses if they ever start attacking the Cat Base.

